WEBVTT

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.230
This is finally it!

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.990
My first step towards becoming a nurse starts today.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.710
In the second year of nursing, we will begin practical training.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:25.910
For that purpose, you will now work together in groups of five.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:27.310
So ensure that you establish strong bonds of communication...

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.680
Whoa! This girl is so cute!

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:29.700
So ensure that you establish strong bonds of communication...

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:36.220
What a flashy girl!

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.880
It’s Irie-san, right?

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.010
Yes.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:41.490
You just transferred over, right?

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.430
Yes. I’m Irie Kotoko.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.560
Originally, I was a fourth year arts student, but...

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:50.330
...I found a big and wonderful dream, and transferred into nursing!

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:54.080
So, you’re older then, Irie-san?

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.200
Let’s not touch on that.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.240
I’m Ogura Tomoko.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:02.570
It’s been a dream of mine since I was young to become a nurse too.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:03.580
Nice to meet you.

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.030
Nice to meet you too.

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:09.320
She’s so cute.

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.370
Like an angel in a white gown.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:14.750
I’m Shinagawa Marina.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.690
My dream is to marry a doctor and move up in social status.

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:23.240
Marrying for money...

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.170
You’re still thinking of such things?

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.230
Don’t go into nursing with that irresponsible attitude of yours!

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:32.870
I like rich and intelligent men.

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:33.740
What did you say?

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.170
I want to give birth to superior children in the future.

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:37.760
There are guys here too.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:42.990
Nursing is an altruistic and sacred job; it’s putting the futures of others ahead of your own!

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:45.000
That hot-blooded guy is Kamogari Keita.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.000
Stop making it sound like I’m some kinda joke!

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.630
I’m aiming to become Japan’s number one nurse!

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.510
As long as I’m alive, I’ll do my utmost!

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:54.670
Say, Irie...

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.720
What’s with that shriek?

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:00.280
Because, I suddenly heard a voice crawling from below the ground.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.030
How rude.

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:04.610
Well, you have a pretty face, but your voice...

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.750
I’m Kikyou Motoki.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.320
Please call me Moto-chan.

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:16.210
Motoki, are you actually...

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:18.070
...a guy...?

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.550
Don’t say it!

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:23.790
Another word about that and we’ll never speak again till hell freezes over!

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:24.590
Okay.

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:28.840
I longed to become a white gowned angel.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.850
So, I chose the path of a nurse!

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.310
I’ll become the woman most suited to wear a nurse’s cap in this world!

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:36.300
Most suitable woman to wear a nurse’s cap?

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:43.170
But more importantly, you have no relation to Irie-san of our medical department, right?

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.810
Irie of the medical department...?

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:51.770
You must be out of the loop if you don’t know who Irie-san is after entering the nursing department.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:52.990
Fourth year medical student.

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:54.390
This university’s...

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:59.430
No, all of Japan’s universities’ most outstanding prodigy, Irie Naoki!

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:00.240
I figured as much.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:05.240
Not only is he intelligent, but he’s incredibly handsome as well!

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:10.470
Yeah. I chose this university because of the rumors that I heard.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:14.490
There’s no other man who matches my conditions so perfectly.

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:15.740
Hey now, Marina!

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:18.210
You’ve been looking at Irie-san that way?

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.060
How disgusting.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:24.230
Sheesh, all of you only think about men!
Your motives are too impure!

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:26.050
What do you mean by impure?

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:28.930
Is it because you’re jealous of how perfect Irie-san is?

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.220
Don’t be stupid!

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:32.080
Like I said earlier! This job is sacred...

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.620
But, he’s married, isn’t he?

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:37.580
What am I hiding? I’m Irie’s...

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:40.350
That’s right. That’s the thing.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:45.830
What kind of girl could make the perfect Irie fall head-over-heels?

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.740
Actually...

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.640
Sure makes you want to see, doesn’t it?

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:53.540
She’s definitely a beautiful, intelligent and talented woman.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.910
Of course!

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:57.100
Otherwise I would not approve!

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.420
Don’t you feel the same way, Kotoko?

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.550
That’s right. I feel exactly the same way.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.120
I got an idea! How about a tour?

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:05.050
Tour?

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.060
After class, we’ll take a tour of the medical department.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:10.300
A tour to admire Irie-san in-person!

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:11.250
I’m in!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.490
I want to go!

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:17.490
Things sure have gotten weird...

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:51.690
What should I do?

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:56.960
I don’t think this situation allows me to say that I’m Irie-kun’s wife...

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.130
There he is!

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:00.170
Okay, confirm this data.
That’s him!

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.000
Irie-kun.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:04.460
He really is my type.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.310
I’m totally entranced just by looking at him.

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:09.470
How divine!

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:11.860
Truly.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:14.340
He’s so handsome.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:16.860
Hey, Irie!

00:06:16.860 --> 00:06:18.000
It’s been a while.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.880
Ugh! It’s Sudou-sempai! Not good!

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.040
Where are you going?

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.320
Well, I’ve had my fun.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:26.950
It’s just begun.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:33.700
Irie, isn’t it about time you bought a car?

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:36.280
I’m having a tough time meeting my quota this month.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.600
Please, buy one.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.450
I’ve told you before! I don’t have a license.

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:43.100
You’ll get in the mood to get a license once you have a car!

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.340
Outsiders aren’t allowed in here.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.120
How unfriendly.

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:50.680
Don’t you ever think of contributing to the welfare of graduates here?

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:52.500
No, I don’t.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.320
You’re interrupting my practical.

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:58.650
He looked this way!

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:00.010
His eyes met mine!

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:01.600
He was looking at me.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.270
Don’t flatter yourself!

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.750
What did you say?!

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.820
Now, now, you two. Calm down.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.040
Hey!

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:12.140
It’s been a while, Sudou-sempai.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.660
Do you know him?

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.250
He was my senior in the tennis club.

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:16.200
Nice to meet you.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:19.610
He’s so cold, that hus–

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:21.620
Unity!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:22.330
Unity?

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:27.240
Yes! “The power of unity” was the motto of our tennis club, right?

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:32.090
Those days sure bring back memories.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:35.140
I’m not talking about that, I’m talking about your hus–

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.250
Harmony!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:41.230
That’s right. Let’s talk about those days of harmonious camaraderie!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.240
Far, far away from here, Sempai!

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:44.980
What was that about?

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:55.490
What is it?

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:58.020
Now that I think about it again...

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:01.000
...I really did marry an incredible person.

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:04.320
And those were your impressions of your first day in nursing?

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:09.740
In the end, I failed to tell them.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:13.760
That I was his wife.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.330
To ensure that neither the patient nor the nurse is burdened when...

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.600
...turning the body, movement at the center of gravity...

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.440
Stop!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.560
Kotoko!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.380
What are you doing?

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:33.320
Sorry.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:36.930
Were you paying attention during the lesson?

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.250
Yeah, I got everything!

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:41.480
Then, why is it turning out like this?

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.110
Can’t breathe...

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.240
That’s odd. I’m sure it was like this...

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:52.400
The restraining technique is about limiting the movement of the patient.

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:54.370
It’s to ensure the safety of the patient.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:56.570
That’s... Why?

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:57.860
Why is it turning out like this?

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.450
This is like the opposite of safety.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:01.720
She’s endangering his life instead...

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.960
Kotoko might be a complete klutz.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.020
What is it? You look down.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:11.660
The nursing practical lessons were harder than I thought.

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:13.900
I wonder if I can make it.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.410
Cheer up!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.650
That’s it! Come over to the shop next time.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:18.780
I’ll cook you something delicious.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:21.060
Really? I’ll go!

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.580
Let’s go, Kotoko.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.400
Yes, I’ll go.

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.660
What are you doing? Hurry and let’s go.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.170
Where are we going?

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.880
You’ll find out when you follow us.

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:36.760
This is...

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:40.320
That’s Irie’s house!

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.800
Why are we doing this again?

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:44.890
To learn more about his wife obviously.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:49.690
If she’s a lazy good-for-nothing who doesn’t do housework, we’ll force him to divorce!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.770
And after that, commence the attack!

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:55.690
Lazy good-for-nothing? Isn’t that a rude thing to say before even seeing her?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.950
What are you getting so flustered about?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.410
It’s just a what-if.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.440
But...

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:03.980
I’ve gotta tell them the truth!

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:06.560
Irie-kun’s wife is...!

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.310
He’s back!

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:09.780
His wife is with him too!

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:11.750
Wife is with him...?

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.800
What a beautiful lady.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.510
She’s quite the beauty.

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:19.910
Matsumoto Yuuko!

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:21.350
Why?

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:24.310
They look like a really good match.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.640
I guess we have no choice but to give up.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:32.080
Then where do I stand in all this?

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:36.970
Welcome home.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:38.340
It’s been a while.

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:39.200
Hello.

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:43.700
I bumped into him at the station. I was so delighted that I decided to intrude.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:47.750
Because of that I wasn’t able to tell them the truth again.

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.610
Nothing, it’s a personal matter.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:53.960
Matsumoto, have you found employment?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.630
Yes, I received an unofficial offer.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:10:59.010
That reminds me.

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:02.370
I heard you transferred into nursing?

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:06.720
As always, you become really strong when it comes to Irie-kun.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:08.820
What the...! Are you making fun of me again?

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:10.530
It’s so like you.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:11.390
Totally.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.890
Well, best of luck.

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:16.180
Matsumoto-san?

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:18.490
Be sure to let me know
when you become a nurse.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:22.490
I’ll be sure to never go to that hospital.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:23.620
Even if it kills me.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:26.790
You can’t go if you’re dead, right?!

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:46.150
Kotoko is so cold.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.600
You just went home immediately without joining us to drink our sorrows away.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.650
I drank so much last night.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.900
No wonder your blood pressure is so high.

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:55.700
Sorry...

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:59.460
But Irie’s wife sure was a great woman.

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:02.950
Feels like we’re completely beaten, in looks and in style.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:05.700
Her personality is extremely horrible though.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:09.200
It’s only natural that great women will follow great men, right?

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.100
Don’t you think so, Kotoko?

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.500
Yeah.

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:15.210
Stop talking about such stupid things and concentrate!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.040
That’s right, guys! Concentrate!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.710
I was talking to you!

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:23.220
How long are you going to keep pumping? The color of my arm has changed!

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:25.720
I’m sorry!

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:32.480
Your pulse!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.270
Why? Is there something wrong with my pulse?

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.010
I don’t hear a pulse!

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.290
Keita-kun, you’re dead!

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:41.650
Wait! That obviously can’t be possible! Idiot!

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:44.150
We’d better get a doctor to look at you.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:48.830
Kotoko.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:53.840
Was there any special reason why you put the stethoscope in backwards?

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.980
Oh my!

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:59.290
You wouldn’t be able to hear
that way, would you?

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:00.300
Quit fooling around!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:04.790
If you have time to chase boys, then have some self-awareness and study harder, will you?!

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:05.930
That’s right.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:10.310
We now know clearly that Irie-san is someone beyond our grasp.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.430
Kotoko.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.690
Irie-san!

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:23.570
Kotoko, my mother asked you to call her because she had a shopping request.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.330
You had your phone switched off, right?

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:31.250
I’ve passed the message then.

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:38.880
Kotoko!

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:41.110
Sorry!

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:42.710
I failed to mention it.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.680
I didn’t lie on purpose.

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:46.040
I’m really sorry!

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:48.090
It’s okay. You don’t have to apologize.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.970
We’re not angry at all.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:52.100
Guys!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:57.460
There’s no need for us to give up
if Kotoko is Irie-san’s wife.

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:59.920
That means there’s still hope!

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:04.740
I wonder what that means...

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.120
Moto-chan, let’s party tonight!

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:08.220
Let’s drink to celebrate!

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:09.740
I’ll join!

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.740
Okay, let’s go!

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:13.190
Let’s go.

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:16.750
Hey, you’re here, Kotoko.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.410
But, why...

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:20.460
...is he with you?

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:25.480
I thought of getting Irie-kun to try your cooking too.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:26.610
I guess that’s all right.

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.470
Since the boss isn’t here because he has a meeting.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.560
He left the kitchen to me.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.000
Isn’t that great, Kin-chan?

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:33.290
You’re a full-fledged chef now.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.850
Welcome.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.960
How’s business, Kotoko?

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:39.190
Idiot! Don’t say that to the customers!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:42.080
Chris, those clothes are really
starting to suit you.

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.640
Thank you very much.

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:46.560
Really! Forcing yourself into maintaining a job here.

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:48.000
It’s a total nuisance.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.450
Who are you kidding?
Aren’t you secretly happy about it?

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:53.580
The scene you caused at the airport was quite unforgettable.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.080
It was really quite a scene, wasn’t it?

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.160
You idiot, Kotoko!

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.450
You didn’t have to say that!

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:00.800
Kinnosuke!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.170
You mustn’t call the customers idiots!

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:06.200
What did you say?!

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:08.470
It’s rude to the customers!

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.490
Then after that, Keita said...

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:17.350
“A retard like you is a hundred years too early to become a nurse.”

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.540
I can’t live a hundred years!

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.230
Is that what you wanted to talk to me about?

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:25.530
No, actually I need a favor.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:30.700
As a penalty for lying to us about being Irie-san’s wife...

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.550
...you have to organize a mixer with the medical department.

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:35.010
And of course, Irie-san must join in.

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:37.060
Okay, Kotoko-san?

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:38.660
...was what they said.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.060
No, thanks.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:42.600
So quickly?

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:46.160
Come on. The medical department which lacks girls and the nursing department which lacks boys.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:48.290
New encounters are needed right?

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:51.620
Is it okay for me to have new encounters?

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:52.990
That’s...

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.010
Right?

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.440
Oh my, Kotoko-chan.

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:02.920
Are you going already?

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.210
Good morning.

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:08.800
What’s wrong? Lately, you’ve been leaving early every morning.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.280
Yeah, it’s just a little something.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.540
It’s not because things aren’t going well with Onii-chan

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:15.030
and it’s difficult for you to be in the house, right?

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:17.710
No, that’s not it.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.680
I just have to do some practical training.

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:21.500
Ah, Kotoko-chan.

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:27.190
Are things going well between them? Especially at night...

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:33.480
If only I hadn’t forgotten everything during practical, then I wouldn’t need to come so early in the morning.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:35.430
Okay, let’s line you guys up nicely.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:39.700
Okay, just one more.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:47.060
Why am I like this?

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:53.810
Kotoko, what happened to that thing about the mixer with Irie-san?

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:55.440
Well, I wasn’t able to...

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:58.170
Hey, we had high hopes for you.

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:00.150
What can I do?

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:03.550
Irie-kun?

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:04.960
Yes, what is it?

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.720
Sorry, but I won’t need dinner tonight.

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:09.430
Please tell my mother too.

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:10.870
What’s up?

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:12.650
I’ll be going drinking tonight.

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:14.130
Oh, I see.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.870
So, that’s how it is.

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.310
Umm, Irie-kun!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.830
What is it?

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:19.480
What’s wrong?

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:24.530
Umm, well, just in case... Can you tell me where you’ll be drinking?

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:27.230
Welcome.

00:17:29.180 --> 00:17:31.110
Irie-san!

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:33.310
What a coincidence!

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:35.110
We’re having a drinking session too!

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.640
Would you like to join us?

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.010
Why did you bring me too?

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:43.780
If it’s just all girls, then it’d look exactly like an ambush, won’t it?

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:45.750
All girls? You’re...!

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:57.680
Aren’t we having fun?!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.840
Surrounded by girls.

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:04.100
Hey.

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:06.980
You can’t hold your liquor.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:09.150
And what about you, Keita? All you’ve been drinking is Oolong tea.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.250
Weakling!

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:11.460
Thank you for that.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:13.350
But, you sure are easygoing.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:14.490
What are you talking about?

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:17.490
Girls are flirting with your husband.

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:22.830
Irie-kun isn’t like those petty,
skirt-chasing guys.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.730
That’s called accompanying.

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:27.990
But still, you’ve been worrying about it this whole time, haven’t you?

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:29.620
Well, I have...

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:33.460
You space out and make mistakes during practical because you’re worrying about your husband everyday.

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:36.640
I wasn’t spacing out!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.870
Besides, you certainly have some nerve to say such things!

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:40.500
I’m older than you!

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.300
How about showing a little respect?

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:45.540
How could I respect someone with such petty thoughts

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:48.390
like becoming a nurse because her husband will be a doctor?

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.310
What did you say?!

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:53.700
Kamogari Keita!

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:55.520
Huh? What’s this all of a sudden?

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:59.790
The blood pressure taking, the restraining technique; I’ll perfect those!

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:09.770
How hopeless.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:11.970
Kotoko-san!

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:14.750
She fell asleep?

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:16.750
I’m taking her home.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.770
If you have time to flirt with girls...

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:24.010
...then how about looking after this girl’s needs a little?

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:25.930
And who are you?

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:29.190
It’s not “you”. It’s Kamogari Keita.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:34.760
It’s none of your business whether I decide to take care of Kotoko’s needs or not.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.320
And...

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.490
...don’t address Kotoko as “this girl”.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:47.650
Kotoko’s determination isn’t halfhearted.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.120
Don’t you know?

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:54.520
She comes early every morning to practice by herself.

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:56.720
She’s very determined.

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:59.820
Just watch, Keita!

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:04.480
I’m gonna become a qualified nurse...

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:10.370
My head hurts.

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:13.320
Kotoko-chan, are you all right?

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.200
You don’t look so good.

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:18.690
Don’t you think you should
go a little later today?

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:21.200
This much isn’t a problem for me.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.710
I’m going now.

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:27.080
I hope she doesn’t overwork herself and damage her health.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.650
Why?

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:35.920
Why can’t I do it right?

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:38.200
I’ve had it!

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.800
Okay, one more time.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.180
Good! Done!

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:53.140
Next is taking blood pressure.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.440
Don’t get the stethoscope backwards this time.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:20:59.900
Keita?

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:01.670
Thanks.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:08.640
What is it?

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:10.050
Nothing.

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:14.900
You’ve already got it wrong.

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:16.970
You can’t fasten the band if you have it on backwards.

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:21.990
Do it again from the start.

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:23.770
Okay...

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:25.380
All right! It’s perfect now.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.280
Idiot, you merely managed
to wrap the band right.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:31.390
Honestly, help me out here.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:32.610
I’m sorry.

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:09.790
What should I do?

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:12.620
I’m really bad with needles!

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:14.410
Fight, Kotoko-chan!

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:15.250
Sheesh.

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:17.980
How do you plan on becoming a nurse if you can’t overcome that?

00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:19.680
Come on, keep your head up!

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:20.540
Keita.

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:24.500
Wait! Aren’t they hitting it off too well?

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:27.040
Onii-chan, what are you doing?

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:29.090
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:30.600
Ill-tempered triangle.

00:23:30.600 --> 00:23:32.460
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
